=head1 DESCRIPTION

Results of a dry run performed in an update domain request.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 DeploymentType => Str

Specifies the way in which OpenSearch Service will apply an update.
Possible values are:

=over

=item *

B<Blue/Green> - The update requires a blue/green deployment.

=item *

B<DynamicUpdate> - No blue/green deployment required

=item *

B<Undetermined> - The domain is in the middle of an update and can't
predict the deployment type. Try again after the update is complete.

=item *

B<None> - The request doesn't include any configuration changes.

=back



=head2 Message => Str

A message corresponding to the deployment type.



